---
// HeroVoronoi.astro — voronoi-cell hero backdrop. Renders a static, baked
// SVG for first paint (works with JS disabled, no layout shift), then
// hero-voronoi-live.ts takes over on mount and regenerates the diagram so
// four content regions — the logo, the nav links, the hero copy, and the
// approach copy — are always fully inside one cell, with no cell edge
// crossing them. Everything else in the diagram stays free to move, and
// re-renders on resize.
//
// Baked geometry is the hero-editor lab's default preset
// (hero-default-preset.mjs, 2026-07-14 session); the live containment
// system was validated against the same lab, 2026-08-07 session (see
// projects/branding/preview/hero-editor/ in the org-os repo). Flat cells
// only for now — the lab's nested "subcell" tissue detail isn't ported yet,
// so this is slightly less textured than the very first baked version.
interface Props { opacity?: number }
const { opacity = 0.5 } = Astro.props;
